>> ++
>> ++ grep -n "TODO:" *.[ch] | sed 's/\([^ ]*\) \(.*\)TODO\(.*\)/\3 (\1)/' | sort -n
>> ++
>> ++Key:
>> ++  :o: Optional
>> ++  :r: Recommended
>> ++  :M: Mandatory
>> ++  :A: Advanced users
>> ++
>> ++This will give you and ordered list of places in the code that you
